# Runtime artifacts of OpenCode itself (plugin dependencies, server state).
#
# The config directory is a merge directory: opencode.jsonc, cli.json,
# AGENTS.md, plugins/ and sync-models.sh are symlinks into the repository,
# while the files below are real files that OpenCode creates and rewrites
# locally. They must never be committed.
#
# This file is tracked on purpose (it used to ignore itself, which made every
# rule below machine-local and invisible to git status).
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json
bun.lock
bun.lockb
service.json
opencode.jsonc.backup
.opencode.jsonc.*.tmp
